<title>CHINA: Shanghai Kaikai interim net up 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Kaikai interim net up 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover	   225.559	  vs	  211.242</p>
<p> Net profit	  34.593	  vs	   30.901</p>
<p> Net asset per share     2.077 yuan   vs     2.215</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.175 yuan   vs     0.335</p>
<p>(The company listed its B shares on January 8, 1997)</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Kaikai Industrial Co Ltd</p>
<p>Note: the results were published in a company statement. The figures are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
</text>
